@cc [owner:ruby-ai-ops,label:security] no-production-mutation
Maintenance commands MUST NOT modify ruby-main or deploy services. A failed transformation or merge MUST leave the accepted upstream cursor unchanged.

@cc [owner:ruby-ai-ops,label:architecture] reproducible-transform
The same source snapshot and versioned transformation rules MUST produce the same output. Reapplying branding MUST be a no-op.

@cc [owner:ruby-ai-ops,label:security] source-names-maintenance-only
Original product names may appear in this maintenance directory for transformation and provenance, but MUST NOT be copied into Ruby application artifacts.

@cc [owner:ruby-ai-ops,label:product;security] preserve-ruby-product-boundaries
Upstream sync candidates MUST preserve every marketing tree entry, the Ruby app/admin theme and fonts, and the approved pricing, credits, and Metronome alert behavior. A violation MUST fail before a candidate branch is created.
